  <p id="c-liangshu-002-nanxu-wangtai:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">十年春正月辛丑，輿駕親祠南郊，大赦天下</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-002-nanxu-wangtai:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">甲辰，以南徐州刺史豫章王<persName id="c-liangshu-002-nanxu-wangtai:p002:m0012" ref="syn_jn4_wiu">綜</persName>爲郢州刺史，輕車將軍南康王<persName id="c-liangshu-002-nanxu-wangtai:p002:m0026" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf_C">績</persName>爲南徐州刺史。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-002-nanxu-wangtai:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">十六年春正月</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-002-nanxu-wangtai:p004" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">二月庚戌，老人星見，甲寅，以安前將軍豫章王<persName id="c-liangshu-002-nanxu-wangtai:p004:m0021" ref="syn_jn4_wiu">綜</persName>爲南徐州刺史。</p>
</text>
